 },
 "summary": "Nine 2 A surface mount Schottky rectifiers in the SMA (DO-214AC) package, SS22 to SS2200, rated from 20 V to 200 V of repetitive reverse voltage. They share the 2.0 A average current and 50 A surge ratings; forward drop, leakage, capacitance and maximum junction temperature step with the voltage class. SS210 is the 100 V type: at most 0.85 V at 2.0 A, 0.3 mA leakage at 25 °C, 80 pF typical, junction up to 150 °C.",
